- RPATH
abstract: Static Zig CLI that builds your own code and installs EasyBuild software
  on top of EESSI-extend, on a Slurm node-local disk or a workstation, with RPATH
  wrappers, per-target list and uninstall, doctor checks and scoped secrets.
